      "sourceIndex": 1703
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 检查代词是否有指代。",
      "sourcePage": 61,
      "sourceIndex": 1704
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 检查主语是否突然换人/换对象。",
      "sourcePage": 61,
      "sourceIndex": 1705
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 检查逻辑连接词是否有前提。",
      "sourcePage": 61,
      "sourceIndex": 1706
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 检查内容是否重复已经说过的话。",
      "sourcePage": 61,
      "sourceIndex": 1707
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5 检查放在当前位置是否引入新主题过早。",
      "sourcePage": 61,
      "sourceIndex": 1708
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
